cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CrysH in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "CrysH: a multi-layer crystal knowledge mapper"
abstract: >-
  CrysH maps a crystal structure to a layered description: L0 validity, L1 periodic
  dimensionality, L2 morphology, L3 local building blocks (coordination, geometry,
  neighbour chemistry, distortion) and L4 motif-network architecture.
authors:
